{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:39:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_a067f423887d4e82be9d896000d8faf8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_658acd5967d19269261de486795c819c53fbd3ce86521543847477224059ec5b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"cfal/garcon@42a5322794a9 snapshot 76fa39f541038aba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c5e35e505d2adcb7e863d6c0dd39210f515cb05b92840d61afe602b54a154876","slc_ce00de365854a22ffb8bae296a97c8088d962a6ced1c438e5e45d13ce47e1b80","slc_e14dfff5175982a6924e3c12889ccb3737dbcdb3104444d91c5e6f576ee1e969"],"source_ids":["src_d065bd85d7505ba6802d09640821a8d4"],"text":"The CLI is invoked as `bun cli/main.ts --workspace <name>` with subcommands such as start-async, search, read, status, and resume-async, including flags like --parent, --agent, --model, and --permissions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:39:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a067f423887d4e82be9d896000d8faf8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:39:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_a067f423887d4e82be9d896000d8faf8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_721a26cbe454ea51cd3886d428dd9aa26b99ebcd449bae9258ea426ec338d9e8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"cfal/garcon@42a5322794a9 snapshot 76fa39f541038aba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b2dcda6381ff7b7adf7b1f5b0fbb7ff723052ed1a3bc98da36c65d04289b6159","slc_f7ed3c3eb3c07d669fceefdaa6071dd73f31a8041e0aefdb613cbcaf03b2fff3"],"source_ids":["src_d065bd85d7505ba6802d09640821a8d4"],"text":"Garcon does not sandbox agents or their commands, which run on the host under the user's account; the README warns against exposing an unauthenticated instance to an untrusted network.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:39:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a067f423887d4e82be9d896000d8faf8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:39:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_a067f423887d4e82be9d896000d8faf8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_75ea4fe2e40dac035fe3fb43623545ee8ca4d97c38e4839f6114275d94f1e545","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"cfal/garcon@42a5322794a9 snapshot 76fa39f541038aba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_291e3f59fed178724c14fd59c7a7363026c73dde398dd274f022c447b596dda0"],"source_ids":["src_d065bd85d7505ba6802d09640821a8d4"],"text":"Tickets persist in the workspace's tickets.sqlite, independent of chats and transcripts; a damaged or unknown-schema store is left unavailable for explicit recovery rather than rebuilt from transcripts.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:39:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a067f423887d4e82be9d896000d8faf8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:39:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_a067f423887d4e82be9d896000d8faf8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_82abca4e5a09be83ec4f3a4e34c315073c324ad2d1cb545e7908398138ab7318","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"cfal/garcon@42a5322794a9 snapshot 76fa39f541038aba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9a8a911bba374f41e9c511cb198604ba58186cd099cd59577c5a5798662739b7","slc_bd0ece6af7939c9467b634450c41bbc3651342355372490853f6338bd1ca171d"],"source_ids":["src_d065bd85d7505ba6802d09640821a8d4"],"text":"Model names may carry a `[Nk]` suffix (100-1000, thousands of tokens) that sets a per-chat Claude auto-compaction window; the annotation overrides CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_COMPACT_WINDOW for that child process only and requires Claude Code 2.1.238+.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:39:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a067f423887d4e82be9d896000d8faf8"}
